B.b5i=new A.w("bible","Deep riddle #939 \u2014 Small in hand, giant on the field; one smooth stone ended my echo. What am I?","Goliath's challenge")
B.bcj=new A.w("bible","Challenge 940: I burned yet was not consumed; a bush spoke from within me. What am I?","The burning bush")
B.b_2=new A.w("street","[Set 31] I speak without a mouth on every corner; ignore me and pay a fine. What am I?","A traffic sign")
B.b6r=new A.w("street","Deep riddle #942 \u2014 I change color but never mood; red stops, green releases. What am I?","A stoplight")
B.b35=new A.w("street","[Set 31] Rolling on four yet carrying hundreds; I stop every block but never walk. What am I?","A city bus")
B.b8_=new A.w("street","[Set 31] I am tagged in spray paint yet tell stories the city tries to erase. What am I?","Graffiti")
B.b1C=new A.w("street","Challenge 945: Sold from a window with no door; hunger knows my bell. What am I? (Think carefully.)","A food truck")
B.b_L=new A.w("church","[Set 31] I rise toward heaven yet stand on earth; bells call the faithful to me. What am I?","A steeple")
